# Drizzle schema

- Edit only [`schema.ts`](src/server/db/schema.ts) and `relations` for schema changes.
- **Never** create or edit `drizzle/`, `migrations/`, or hand-written `*.sql` migration files.
- After schema changes: tell the user to run `npm run db:generate`; the user applies migrations. Do not run `db:*` scripts unless the user asks.
- Full development workflow: [`.cursor/commands/develop.md`](.cursor/commands/develop.md).
